// E0353: the async runtime's machinery is internal to the standard library.
// Work that blocks goes to `Task::spawn_blocking`, never to the blocking
// pool or its jobs directly, and `Futures::join`, `try_join`, `select` and
// `timeout` return `implement Future<...>`, so a program names the output
// and never the machine behind it.  A job's header and the pool's own
// methods are reached only through those types, so they go with them.
![config(testing)]
![config(negative, E0353)]
namespace CryoTests::Negative::E0353AsyncInternalsAreInternal;

